+### Extra effects (`src/effects/extra.tsx`)
+
+Twelve more effects from the effect wish list. Same rules as above; texts in the language of the video.
+
+| kind | Name | What happens on screen | Ingredients | Texts |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `graphsplit` | Graph split | on `at` a white line splits the frame: a bar chart grows on the left, you move to the right half | `face` | `lines` [small label, title]; no made-up numbers |
+| `flightmap` | Flight map | a map behind you, a red route draws from city A to city B, a plane flies along. Without cut-out the video shrinks into a card at the bottom | better with Cut-out | `lines` [from, to], `at` = take-off |
+| `comment` | Comment box | an Instagram "Reply to …'s comment" sticker pops up above the head | `face` | `prompt` comment text, `handle`, `avatar` |
+| `roomswap` | Room swap | on `at` a light wipe swaps the room behind you for a photo, you stay. Without cut-out: whip blur | Cut-out, photo `src`, `plate` | |
+| `notes` | Apple Notes | a notes screen slides up, the checklist ticks itself off (struck through), the last item is highlighted; your video sits on the right as an attachment | | `word` title, `lines` items (default: names of the numbered effects), `at` = first tick |
+| `stopmotion` | Stop motion | the picture runs at 7.5 frames per second, every frame jitters slightly, grain and vignette | `face` | |
+| `funnel` | Word funnel | words fly into a glass funnel above the head, the funnel folds away and one word comes out | `face` | `lines` incoming words (up to 10), `word` the result |
+| `tunnel` | Glass tunnel | frames inside frames with glass rims, the camera keeps flying through them | `face` as the tunnel centre | |
+| `prompt` | Prompt box | an input field above the head, the prompt is typed, the send button is pressed and the box flies away | `face` | `prompt`; `at` = send (default right after typing) |
+| `disappear` | Disappear | on `at` you dissolve into dust and leave the empty room. Stays empty until `to` | Cut-out, `plate`, `face` | |
+| `thrown` | Thrown in | a sticker or photo is thrown in from the bottom left, lands next to the head on `at` with a shake | `face`, optional photo `src` | `word` sticker text (without `src`) |
+| `bell` | Follow bell | profile card above the head, a cursor taps Follow on `at`, then the bell, which rings | `face` | `handle`, `avatar` |
+
 ## Colours
 
 `theme` in `project.ts` overrides individual colours, for example
